<article class="rci-programme-card rci-programme-card-featured"><div class="rci-card-top"><span>BOARD YEARS</span><b>02</b></div><div class="rci-grade">10 <i>—</i> 12</div><h3>Prepare with clarity and purpose.</h3><p>Focused academic support through standards 10th, 11th and 12th, with board examinations in view.</p><div class="rci-card-foot"><span>STANDARDS 10TH–12TH</span><span>↗</span></div></article></div></section>
